        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our employers are able to cost-effectively attract the right job seekers in our marketplace compared to other online recruiting sites and traditional “offline” recruiting service providers due to the combination of the strength of our job seeker community and our proven matching technology that continues to get smarter over time.",
