        "statement": "We are subject to many varying laws and regulations in the United States, Canada, the European Union, the United Kingdom, Israel and throughout the world, including those related to privacy, data protection, AI (including machine learning), content regulation, intellectual property, consumer protection, e-commerce, marketing, advertising, messaging, rights of publicity, health and safety, employment and labor, product liability, accessibility, competition, and taxation.",
